ta-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\\}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(A,\\Gamma)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Gamma\\land\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ [B\\le_mA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(A,\\Gamma)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Gamma\\land\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ [B\\le_mA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>完全性分为“属于该层级”和“对该层级困难”两部分。仅能归约到一个集合并不能证明该集合位于该层级。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.2.1；印刷页 83；PDF 第 119 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-4","tar